3. Communication Plan
Meeting Cadence
- Daily Stand-up — Daily (per team). Short status sync per team (Mobile, Web, Backend/API, Mapping, Payment, QA): what I did, what I'll do, blockers.
- Cross-Team Progress Meeting — Weekly. Deeper check-in across all six teams; surfaces integration risks early.
- Sprint / Stakeholder Meeting — Monthly. Demo working increments to the city client; big-picture progress against the project timeline.

Reporting Methods
- Executives / City Stakeholders — Dashboard + monthly demo. High-level milestone status, budget burn, key risk flags (no technical detail).
- Developers / Teams — Jira backlog & sprint board. Detailed tasks, sprint progress, blockers.
- Risk Tracking — Risk Register review. Reviewed and updated at each weekly cross-team meeting; new Critical/High risks escalated immediately.